@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include loan-style.puml
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Lab technician" as User
component "Bob / Ui\nConsole and application lifecycle" as Console
component "Parser\nCommand validation and dispatch" as Logic

package "Model" {
    component "AppState\nShared application state" as State
    component "Model managers\nInventory, sessions, contacts,\nrequests, loans, broken reports" as Managers
}

package "Storage" as Persistence {
    component "Storage\nFile selection, backup, atomic replacement" as Storage
    component "SnapshotCodec\nStrict JSON and domain validation" as Codec
}

artifact "AppSnapshot\nImmutable storage records" as Snapshot
database "Local files\ndata/bob.json\ndata/bob.json.bak" as Files

User --> Console : enters commands / reads responses
Console --> Logic : handleCommand(input, state)
Logic --> Managers : execute commands
Console --> State : export / restore state
State --> Managers : owns
Console --> Storage : load() / save(snapshot)
Storage --> Codec : decode() / encode()
Storage --> Files : read / replace complete files
State ..> Snapshot : toSnapshot() / restore()
Codec ..> Snapshot : JSON conversion
Codec ..> State : validate in temporary state

note bottom of Managers
  Loans and broken reports share Inventory.
  Broken reports also share ContactManager.
end note
@enduml
